I think there's a pattern that people see once they start with all this negativity of oh, I'm upset about this, blah, blah, blah, blah, blah. I think over time they start to see a shift, and the writing becomes more positive. So I think that's part of the benefit of it is that the negative effect sort of starts to show this gradual shift toward positivity. And then they just get the benefit of journaling, period,

