00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:53.000
of just writing about whatever. You know, I saw a beautiful sunset today or whatever. Are there demographic differences in complaining? Do we know by nationality or age or even whether men complain more than women or vice versa? So we have looked at the gender. I want to be super careful how I say this. So in one of our studies, we had people list their pet peeves, which really are very specific complaints that people have. And the instructions were to list their pet peeves that they had with a relational partner.

37
00:21:53.000 --> 00:22:15.000
