39
00:22:39.000 --> 00:23:09.000
In terms of nationality, we've never done any cross-cultural research, but I would love to. And one of the things that I think would happen is, you know, you complain when your expectations haven't been met. That's what fuels your dissatisfaction. And I so want to do this before I retire. I think that cultures that have the most to complain about, whether there's just, you know, such poverty, I would suspect that they complain the least.

40
00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:40.000
